DESCRIPTION:Book Smarts\n\nA Live Comedy Experience Inspired by the Written
  Word\n\nWhat do a text from your mom\, a one-star customer review\, a grou
 p chat gone off the rails\, and a page from a book have in common?\n\nThey 
 all have the potential to become comedy.\n\nBook Smarts  is a one-of-a-kin
 d live comedy experience where stand-up comedians transform everyday writin
 g into original\, laugh-out-loud performances. Drawing inspiration from tex
 ts\, emails\, reviews\, books\, letters\, social media posts\, and more\, e
 ach comedian creates a fresh set built around the written word.\n\nBecause 
 every comic chooses different material\,  no two Book Smarts shows are eve
 r the same . Every performance is a brand-new experience filled with unexpe
 cted stories\, clever observations\, and original comedy you won’t see an
 ywhere else.\n\nCome discover how ordinary words become extraordinary laugh
 s.\n\nBook Smarts\n\nInspired by the Written Word. Delivered Through Comedy
 \n\nPlease note\, there is a 2 item per person minimum in the showroom. Thi
 s can be any combination of food items or beverages. This does NOT include 
